      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for starting that. it's cut off at the end though, can you finish the guide? \n\nalso, the score for this one is still a bit low for what i need. the manual is looking empty in the index. can you expand the guide and make sure it has a much higher step count? just make sure the steps are actual things they can do to fix the hub, i don't want it to look like total nonsense to the customers, but i definitely need that step count to go up so it ranks higher.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
